WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.330
Uzun arqonni bir joyidan tortib qo‘yib yuborsak, do‘mboq ikkiga bo‘linib, ikki tomonga yuguradi.

2
00:00:06.330 --> 00:00:08.902
Bugun buni formula bilan tushuntiramiz.

3
00:00:08.902 --> 00:00:18.134
Darsdan so‘ng siz cheksiz tor uchun Koshi masalasini Dalamber formulasi yordamida yecha olasiz va javobni tenglamaga qo‘yib tekshira olasiz.

4
00:00:18.384 --> 00:00:23.420
Masala: u t t teng a kvadrat u x x, butun son o‘qida.

5
00:00:23.420 --> 00:00:30.927
Boshlang‘ich shakl u x nol teng fi x, boshlang‘ich tezlik u t x nol teng psi x.

6
00:00:30.927 --> 00:00:38.434
Oldingi mavzudan bilamiz: umumiy yechim f x ayiruv a t qo‘shuv g x qo‘shuv a t.

7
00:00:38.434 --> 00:00:42.710
Ikki boshlang‘ich shartdan f va g ni topamiz.

8
00:00:42.960 --> 00:00:50.304
Natija — Dalamber formulasi: u teng fi x ayiruv a t va fi x qo‘shuv a t ning o‘rtachasi,

9
00:00:50.304 --> 00:00:57.897
qo‘shuv bir bo‘lingan ikki a karra psi ning x ayiruv a t dan x qo‘shuv a t gacha integrali.

10
00:00:57.897 --> 00:01:02.654
Diqqat: integral oldida bir bo‘lingan ikki a, yarim emas.

11
00:01:02.904 --> 00:01:10.392
Misol: u t t teng to‘qqiz u x x, boshlang‘ich shakl x kvadrat, boshlang‘ich tezlik x.

12
00:01:10.392 --> 00:01:12.154
Bu yerda a teng uch.

13
00:01:12.154 --> 00:01:19.378
Birinchi qism: x ayiruv uch t kvadrati va x qo‘shuv uch t kvadratining o‘rtachasi,

14
00:01:19.378 --> 00:01:23.078
ya’ni x kvadrat qo‘shuv to‘qqiz t kvadrat.

15
00:01:23.328 --> 00:01:30.672
Ikkinchi qism: bir oltidan karra s ning x ayiruv uch t dan x qo‘shuv uch t gacha integrali.

16
00:01:30.672 --> 00:01:38.258
Bu bir o‘n ikkidan karra kvadratlar ayirmasi, ya’ni o‘n ikki x t bo‘lingan o‘n ikki, teng x t.

17
00:01:38.258 --> 00:01:43.262
Javob: u teng x kvadrat qo‘shuv to‘qqiz t kvadrat qo‘shuv x t.

18
00:01:43.512 --> 00:01:44.758
Tekshiramiz.

19
00:01:44.758 --> 00:01:47.043
u t t teng o‘n sakkiz.

20
00:01:47.043 --> 00:01:55.662
To‘qqiz karra u x x teng to‘qqiz karra ikki, ya’ni o‘n sakkiz: tenglama bajariladi.

21
00:01:55.662 --> 00:01:58.778
t teng nolda u teng x kvadrat.

22
00:01:58.778 --> 00:02:04.074
u t teng o‘n sakkiz t qo‘shuv x, t nolda x ga teng.

23
00:02:04.074 --> 00:02:06.878
Uchala shart ham bajarildi.

24
00:02:07.128 --> 00:02:13.811
Grafikda boshlang‘ich impuls bir bo‘lingan bir qo‘shuv x kvadrat va uning t teng uch paytdagi holati.

25
00:02:13.811 --> 00:02:21.156
Impuls balandligi yarim bo‘lgan ikki bo‘lakka bo‘lingan va ular x teng plyus-minus uch nuqtalarga yetib kelgan.

26
00:02:21.156 --> 00:02:24.398
Shakl o‘zgarmaydi, faqat a tezlik bilan siljiydi.

27
00:02:24.648 --> 00:02:30.012
Savol: boshlang‘ich shakl sinus x, tezlik nol, a teng bir.

28
00:02:30.012 --> 00:02:31.307
Yechim qanday?

29
00:02:31.307 --> 00:02:38.150
Ikki yuguruvchi sinusoidaning yig‘indisini ko‘paytmaga aylantirib ko‘ring.
